# Downloaded binaries land in `<version>/<target>/` under this directory. The
# pattern matches every two-component path here, which covers both the lock
# files and the per-target directories — and once a directory is ignored, git
# does not descend into it, so the extracted binary is covered too.
#
# `steins` (this directory's only tracked file) has no slash and is unaffected.
*/*
